# Local state and anything that could carry a credential into the repo.
#
# A saved plan records every variable value in plaintext whatever `sensitive`
# says, and packages every .tf file in the directory including any override.
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
override.tf
override.tf.json
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
plan.json
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl.bak
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Variables files. Nothing here should carry a credential -- the provider reads
# GITHUB_TOKEN from the environment -- but this is where one would end up. The
# generated import ids hold public GitHub ids and are committed on purpose.
.env
.env.*
.envrc
*.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
*.auto.tfvars.json
!tofu/import-ids.auto.tfvars.json

# CLI config, which is where a registry or provider token is stored.
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
.tofurc
tofu.rc

# Key material.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519

node_modules/
.DS_Store
